Firewall 	--> Switch to root user: "su -"
	 	--> Install UFW: "apt install ufw"
	 	--> block incoming requests: "ufw default deny incoming"
	 	--> allow outgoing requests: "ufw default allow outgoing"
	 	--> allow traffic on port 4242: "ufw allow 4242"
	 	--> enable UFW: "enable ufw"
	 	--> delete ufw rule: "ufw delete allow 8080"
	 	--> list ufw rules: "ufw status"

